OL,3,ADutch broadcaster Avrotros pulls out of
OL,4,A2027 Eurovision Song Contest
OL,5,
OL,6,FDutch public broadcaster Avrotros has
OL,7,Fpulled out of next year's Eurovision
OL,8,FSong Contest, saying that the
OL,9,Fcompetition can no longer be considered
OL,10,Fneutral while a participating country
OL,11,Fremains involved in a large-scale
OL,12,Fmilitary conflict.
OL,14,FIn a statement released on Monday, the
OL,15,Fbroadcaster said the decision was due
OL,16,Fto a lack of clarity from organisers -
OL,17,Fthe European Broadcasting Union (EBU) -
OL,18,Fover assessing which countries could
OL,19,Fcompete.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11911
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787600897
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADutch broadcaster Avrotros pulls out of
OL,4,A2027 Eurovision Song Contest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvrotros added: "The severe
OL,7,Fhumanitarian suffering in Gaza and the
OL,8,Fongoing restrictions on press freedom
OL,9,Fhave contributed to increasing
OL,10,Fdivisions surrounding the Eurovision
OL,11,FSong Contest in recent years."
OL,13,FEarlier this month, the EBU updated its
OL,14,Frules to state that if a country
OL,15,Finvolved in an armed conflict wins the
OL,16,Fcompetition, it will be ineligible to
OL,17,Fhost it the following year. But
OL,18,FAvrotros said those changes "do not
OL,19,Fprovide sufficient confidence that
OL,20,Fb@Lthe bA independent and neutral
OL,21,Fcharacter of the Eurovision Song
OL,22,FContest has been restored".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
